// The transform package: rotations as quaternions and rigid transforms
// as matrices, as functions any Kernel calls. A rig poses joints with
// them, a camera orbits with them, a particle turns with them; each
// would otherwise write them again. There are no Kernels here, only the
// arithmetic they share.
package transform@1 { language = 1; ir = 1; }

use "kernels/";
